VERSION 1.9.4
-------------------------

  o bedToCg: the bedtools/yame pipeline reached sh -c unquoted, so sh ran a
    bare `yame` and the output file was empty. It is now quoted.
  o testEnrichment2: the odds ratio is computed in double precision. Integer
    counts from YAME overflowed on genome-scale tables and gave NA estimates.
  o testEnrichment2: an unmeetable min_overlap returns the empty result
    without a second warning.
  o KYCG_plotEnrichAll: geom_segment(linewidth=), not the deprecated size=.

VERSION 1.9.3
-------------------------

  o testEnrichmentSEA: the two tails now share one pooled permutation
    null, so the p-value no longer depends on the sign of the query
    (zhou-lab/knowYourCG#6)
  o testEnrichmentSEA: the sign of estimate is flipped to match GSEA.
    Positive now means the set is enriched at large values, negative at
    small values. Results from earlier versions have the opposite sign.
    KYCG_plotSetEnrichment now walks from the largest value down.

VERSION 0.99.0
-------------------------

  o First submission of knowYourCG package to Bioconductor
